Modifications in this repository:
  - extracted the task/growth-task functionality into a standalone CLI
    (cmd/tasksweep) that does not start the HTTP proxy;
  - added structured, AI-friendly JSON output and stable exit codes;
  - added cli_export.go to expose the task runner without the HTTP panel;
  - removed the original proxy server entrypoint from this repository's
    build target (the copied internal packages remain for task logic).

This project is for personal, self-hosted use with your own authorized
accounts only. It is not affiliated with Tencent, CodeBuddy, or WorkBuddy.
Use at your own risk; automated task execution may violate upstream terms
and can lead to account restrictions.
